Falsifies `globally_unique_identifier_partition_table::verification::the_header_fields_partition_the_block`.

The defect: `decode_fields` reads `entry_size` from the `entry_count` offset: two fields claim one offset and
the `entry_size` bytes belong to nobody. Re-encoding writes the count's bytes where the size's were.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert_eq!(round_tripped[24..92], block[24..92])`.

diff --git a/crates/globally_unique_identifier_partition_table/src/header.rs b/crates/globally_unique_identifier_partition_table/src/header.rs
